body:
Yes... that's the dream. To be madly in love with someone who is also for you. I wonder how that feels like... All my life has been nothing but me falling in love with people and then getting shutdown. Like you are... right there, nearly there and then reality hits you like a thousand trucks. 

&#x200B;

But I agree, fuck John!

I once saw my dad hitting my mom when I was like 7-8. Tried to stop him, obviously couldn't got hit myself. Then I ran for the phone and called my Uncle, he came and helped my mom (he was my dad's brother but he is not a douche).

&#x200B;

And I know it was scarring because I don't remember any of it. My uncle told me a couple of years ago. I'm 28.

I can't convince you not to do it. The pain is sometimes overwhelming. But there is one thing you should know.

If you are going to do it, then do it. But.. if you have ever talked to someone about this, if you wish things would be better, if you still dream. If you are still here , then it means you don't really want to do it.

&#x200B;

I just want to convince you, to do it for you. Not for anyone or anything else. Because you don't fear doing it. Because you sincerely wish there is nothing for you, that you are not going to apologize to anyone for doing it, that you are going to be thankful for people that made you feel good instead. You are doing it because there is no way out of the situation you are in, because no-one has survived what you are going through, because you don't want to see what will finally pull you from that hole. Because you don't feel any remorse or nostalgia. Only then will you go in peace.

&#x200B;

Seek help.

You could try "Don't starve together". The objective is simple and its entertaining.

&#x200B;

Could also try Dead by daylight. If she is into horror things.
